{
	"info": {
		"name": "Savory Studio – APG-73 Restaurant CRUD, Staff Auth & REST-05 QA",
		"description": "Colección QA de integración para APG-73 (DAT-02 · AUTH-03 · REST-01 a REST-05).\n\nCubre:\n- Creación (POST /api/restaurantes), consulta (GET /api/restaurantes/mios, GET /api/restaurantes/{id}) y actualización (PATCH /api/restaurantes/{id})\n- Gestión de personal (POST, GET, DELETE /api/restaurants/{restaurantId}/staff)\n- Aislamiento entre restaurantes (OwnerA vs OwnerB vs StaffA vs Outsider)\n- Publicación de promociones autorizada por REST-05 (dueño y empleado vinculado) y revocación inmediata tras desvinculación\n- Matriz completa de respuestas HTTP: 201, 200, 204, 400, 401, 403, 404, 409\n\n**Ejecución recomendada:**\nEjecutar con Collection Runner o Newman en orden secuencial sobre `{{baseUrl}}` (por defecto `http://localhost:8080`).",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{ "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
		{ "key": "runTag", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "ownerAEmail", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "ownerAToken", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "ownerAId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "ownerBEmail", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "ownerBToken", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "ownerBId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "staffAEmail", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "staffAToken", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "staffAId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "outsiderEmail", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "outsiderToken", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "outsiderId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "restaurantAId", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "restaurantBId", "value": "" }
	],
	"item": [
